# 7. Terraform State & Provider Binaries
# tfstate holds secrets in plaintext (RDS passwords, Secrets Manager values,
# IAM attributes). .tfvars holds local variable values. Both stay local.
# Tracked on purpose: *.tf and *.tfvars.example
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example

